      "writtenOn": "2022-06-23T16:33:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was really on the fence about this change for just about those reasons. The one thing that bothered me about putting it at the top of every function: how are we going to prevent running into this problem again? I believe presubmit only runs on cuttlefish which always runs the newest kernel. I really wish there was some way to annotate methods with something like `@RequiresKernelVersion(\"5.0\")` and have let the test fail if the assumption wasn\u0027t explicitly checked when calling these methods.\nIn any case, I will wrap the assumption check in a function for readability and put it back to the top off the method. :)\n\n-\u003e fixed in aosp/2134523",
